            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An oral pouched product is disclosed, the pouched product comprising a saliva permeable pouch and a pouch composition, the pouch composition comprising a powdered composition, water, and a liquid flavor composition, wherein the liquid flavor composition is added to the powdered composition after the water. A further oral pouched product and a method of manufacturing an oral pouched product is disclosed.</p>
